      "description": "56px fixed bar: logo left, hairline-separated mono tabs right; the current tab is blue with its label in angle brackets.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><span class=\"ds-nav__logo\">SKYFALL AI</span><ul class=\"ds-nav__tabs\"><li><a href=\"#\" class=\"ds-nav__tab ds-nav__tab--current\">&lt;SKY-001&gt;</a></li><li><a href=\"#\" class=\"ds-nav__tab\">Blog</a></li></ul></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:stretch;justify-content:space-between;height:56px;padding:0 40px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0}.ds-nav__logo{display:flex;align-items:center;font-family:'Geist Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#1a1a1a}.ds-nav__tabs{display:flex;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;font-family:'Geist Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-transform:uppercase}.ds-nav__tabs li{display:flex}.ds-nav__tab{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 22px;color:#1a1a1a;background:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-right:1px solid #e0e0e0;transition:background .3s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),color .3s}.ds-nav__tabs li:first-child .ds-nav__tab{border-left:1px solid #e0e0e0}.ds-nav__tab:hover{background:#f6f6f6}.ds-nav__tab--current,.ds-nav__tab--current:hover{background:#3e57da;border-color:#3e57da;color:#fff;font-weight:600}.ds-nav__tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #3e57da;outline-offset:-2px}"
